{'symbol': 'TGT', 'date': '2022-08-10 16:15:00', 'title': "GRACE PUMA APPOINTED TO TARGET CORPORATION'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS", 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS , AUG. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TARGET CORPORATION (NYSE: TGT) ANNOUNCED TODAY ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS ELECTED GRACE PUMA AS A NEW DIRECTOR, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. SHE WILL SERVE ON THE AUDIT & RISK AND INFRASTRUCTURE & FINANCE COMMITTEES.'}